{{!-- Featured hero — page 1 of a channel, above the post grid.

     The hero is the first post Ghost returns for the channel (`posts`[0]), not a post
     chosen by a query of its own. Two consequences, both wanted:

     * the same post can never be displayed twice: the grid below
       (partials/listing-grid.hbs) renders the same `posts` list starting at
       `{{#foreach from="2"}}`, so the hero is simply its first item;
     * `/` stays what routes.yaml makes it — the unfiltered, mixed feed — and
       /en/, /es/ and /br/ stay scoped to their own collection filter. Nothing here
       filters, so the theme cannot re-apply a language.

     Ghost's `featured` flag is not consulted and there is no `featured_only` /
     `featured_tag` theme setting any more: the hero is the newest post of the channel.
     That is the deliberate trade for "never twice" — promoting a featured post from
     further down the list would pull a card out of the grid.

     One file per locale, like partials/post-card.hbs: the label, the date format and the
     reading-time strings are printed inside `{{#foreach}}`, where Ghost drops partial
     hash arguments (verified), so they are literals in the markup rather than arguments
     chosen by the caller. Keep the three copies in step.

     The page guard `{{^is "paged"}}` belongs here too: page 2 has no hero, so its grid
     starts at the top. --}}
{{^is "paged"}}{{#foreach posts from="1" to="1"}}<a href="{{url}}"
    class="group block mb-12 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-border-subtle bg-raised hover:border-brand-purple transition-colors">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2">
        {{#if feature_image}}
        <div class="aspect-[16/9] lg:aspect-auto overflow-hidden">
            <img src="{{img_url feature_image size="l" format="webp"}}"
                alt="{{#if feature_image_alt}}{{feature_image_alt}}{{else}}{{title}}{{/if}}"
                loading="eager"
                fetchpriority="high"
                decoding="async"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-300">
        </div>
        {{/if}}
        <div class="p-6 md:p-8 flex flex-col justify-center">
            <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-purple uppercase tracking-wider mb-3 font-mono">Featured</span>
            {{#if primary_tag}}
            <span class="text-xs text-subtle-text uppercase tracking-wider mb-2">{{primary_tag.name}}</span>
            {{/if}}
            <h2
                class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-strong group-hover:text-brand-purple transition-colors leading-tight mb-3">
                {{title}}</h2>
            <p class="text-sm text-muted line-clamp-3 mb-4">{{excerpt words="30"}}</p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-xs text-subtle-text">
                <span>{{#foreach authors limit="1"}}{{name}}{{/foreach}}</span>
                <span>&middot;</span>
                <span>{{date published_at format="MMM d, YYYY"}}</span>
                <span>&middot;</span>
                <span>{{reading_time minute=(t "Just a minute or less") minutes=(t "Takes about % minutes to read")}}</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</a>{{/foreach}}{{/is}}
